  'DNAME'  - NAME OF A DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE VOLUMES         04150037
             ALLOCATED TO THE DATA AND INDEX COMPONENTS OF A KEY-       04200037
             SEQUENCED CLUSTER OR AN ALTERNATE INDEX,                   04250037
             OR THAT IDENTIFIES THE PRIME CRA VOLUME FOR AN             04300037
             ALTERNATE INDEX.                                           04350037
))DEVICETYPE('DEVTYPE')                                                 04850037
           - SPECIFIES THE DEVICE TYPE OF THE VOLUME THAT CONTAINS A    04900037
